Changes from upstream (summary):
  * Removed the Lens / live-camera / OCR / Code-Mode feature only. All other
    features (Assistant, Voice, Models, image generation, RAG/knowledge base,
    Hugging Face downloads, Core AI models, Edge0 native runtime, Background
    Assets, Local API, Mac bridge, Share extension) are kept unchanged.
  * New identity: Mahalli / com.justmgz.mahalli, new code-drawn icon.
  * Light, minimal, Arabic-first (RTL) "Sahl" palette with IBM Plex Sans
    Arabic and Saudi-dialect Arabic strings for the main screens.

